<rtept lat="51.5396800000" lon="-4.2085100000">
<time>2026-01-19T09:59:11Z</time>
<name>The Salthouse</name>
<desc>Salt House Mere is just next to the Salt House in Port Eynon. It is a pebbly cove which is in part sandy. This is a perfect place for bird watching, walking, observing marine life, caves all with breathtaking scenery. When the tide is out, it is possible to walk onto Port Eynon Point, which has been compared to a lunar landscape. Beware that it is not advisable to bathe off Port Eynon Point. The cove is pretty and quiet.</desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
<extensions>
<xstyle:fill>
<xstyle:color>ff0000</xstyle:color>
</xstyle:fill>
</extensions>
</rtept>
